    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>SectionCraft is a powerful Gutenberg container block that gives you full control over your page sections.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Width Presets</strong> — Choose from 830px, 1024px, 1131px, 1329px, 1593px, 1906px, Full Width, or a Custom width</li>\n<li><strong>Padding Control</strong> — Set Top, Bottom, Left, Right padding individually for desktop and mobile</li>\n<li><strong>Background Options</strong> — Solid color or gradient background (with angle and dual-color support)</li>\n<li><strong>Background Shapes</strong> — Add decorative SVG shapes (Circle, Square, Blob, Triangle, Ring) with full position, size, opacity, rotation, and color control</li>\n<li><strong>Image Shapes</strong> — Use custom images as background decorative elements</li>\n<li><strong>Allow Overlap</strong> — Option to let the block overlap adjacent elements</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>section-craft</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open the Block Editor (Gutenberg) and search for &#8220;SectionCraft&#8221; in the block inserter.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20work%20with%20the%20classic%20editor%3F\">\nDoes this plugin work with the Classic Editor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. SectionCraft is a Gutenberg block and requires the Block Editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20add%20multiple%20background%20shapes%3F\">\nCan I add multiple background shapes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can add as many shapes as you like, each with its own position, size, color, opacity, and rotation.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added mobile padding controls</li>\n<li>Added image shape support</li>\n<li>Added Allow Overlap option</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A Gutenberg container block with width control, background shapes, images, and gradient support.",
    "description": "<p>SectionCraft is a powerful Gutenberg container block that gives you full control over your page sections.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Width Presets</strong> — Choose from 830px, 1024px, 1131px, 1329px, 1593px, 1906px, Full Width, or a Custom width</li>\n<li><strong>Padding Control</strong> — Set Top, Bottom, Left, Right padding individually for desktop and mobile</li>\n<li><strong>Background Options</strong> — Solid color or gradient background (with angle and dual-color support)</li>\n<li><strong>Background Shapes</strong> — Add decorative SVG shapes (Circle, Square, Blob, Triangle, Ring) with full position, size, opacity, rotation, and color control</li>\n<li><strong>Image Shapes</strong> — Use custom images as background decorative elements</li>\n<li><strong>Allow Overlap</strong> — Option to let the block overlap adjacent elements</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/sectioncraft.1.1.0.zip",
